msgid "1AB Stats"
msgstr "1AB Stats"

#. Description of the plugin
#: 1ab-stats.php
msgid "Cookieless visitor statistics with affiliate click tracking. No cookies, no stored IP addresses, all data stays on your own server."
msgstr "Besucherstatistik ohne Cookies mit Klickmessung für Partnerlinks. Keine Cookies, keine gespeicherten IP-Adressen, alle Daten bleiben auf dem eigenen Server."

#. Author of the plugin
#: 1ab-stats.php
msgid "Alexander Boeckmann"
msgstr "Alexander Boeckmann"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:63
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:72
msgid "You are not allowed to change these settings."
msgstr "Du darfst diese Einstellungen nicht ändern."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:107
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Übersicht"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:108
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:113
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Einstellungen gespeichert."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:132
msgid "Data retention"
msgstr "Aufbewahrung"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:133
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:137
msgid "days"
msgstr "Tage"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:134
msgid "0 keeps the data without limit. Otherwise older entries are deleted once a day."
msgstr "0 bewahrt die Daten unbegrenzt auf. Sonst werden ältere Einträge einmal am Tag gelöscht."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:136
msgid "Recognise returning visitors for"
msgstr "Wiederkehrende Besucher erkennen für"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:138
msgid "After this time the random value behind the visitor identifier is replaced. Older identifiers can then no longer be matched. 1 is the most privacy-friendly choice."
msgstr "Nach dieser Zeit wird der Zufallswert hinter der Besucher-Kennung ersetzt. Ältere Kennungen lassen sich dann nicht mehr zuordnen. 1 ist die datensparsamste Wahl."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:140
msgid "More affiliate link domains"
msgstr "Weitere Domains für Partnerlinks"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:142
msgid "One domain per line. Clicks on links to Amazon and eBay are always counted."
msgstr "Eine Domain je Zeile. Klicks auf Links zu Amazon und eBay werden immer gezählt."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:144
msgid "Proxy or CDN"
msgstr "Proxy oder CDN"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:145
msgid "My site is behind a proxy or CDN that passes the visitor address in the X-Forwarded-For header"
msgstr "Meine Seite liegt hinter einem Proxy oder CDN, der die Besucher-Adresse in der Kopfzeile X-Forwarded-For weitergibt"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:146
msgid "Only tick this if it is true for your site. Otherwise all visitors behind the proxy may be counted as one, or visitor numbers can be inflated by forged headers."
msgstr "Nur ankreuzen, wenn das für deine Seite zutrifft. Sonst zählen womöglich alle Besucher hinter dem Proxy als einer, oder gefälschte Kopfzeilen treiben die Besucherzahl hoch."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:148
msgid "What is counted"
msgstr "Was gezählt wird"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:148
msgid "Logged-in users, previews, robots and browsers that send \"Do Not Track\" are not counted. No cookie is set and nothing is stored in the visitor's browser. The visitor address is never stored."
msgstr "Angemeldete Benutzer, Vorschauen, Roboter und Browser mit „Do Not Track“ werden nicht gezählt. Es wird kein Cookie gesetzt und nichts im Browser des Besuchers gespeichert. Die Adresse des Besuchers wird nie gespeichert."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:198
msgid "no data for the previous period"
msgstr "keine Daten für den Vorzeitraum"

#. translators: %s: change in percent with sign, e.g. +12 %
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:203
#, php-format
msgid "%s vs. previous period"
msgstr "%s zum Vorzeitraum"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:219
msgid "Nothing counted yet."
msgstr "Noch nichts gezählt."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:226
msgid "Count"
msgstr "Anzahl"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:228
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:329
msgid "Visitors"
msgstr "Besucher"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:252
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:275
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Unbekannt"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:271
msgid "Phone"
msgstr "Handy"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:272
msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "Tablet"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:273
msgid "Computer"
msgstr "Computer"

#. translators: %d: number of days
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:322
#, php-format
msgid "%d day"
msgid_plural "%d days"
msgstr[0] "%d Tag"
msgstr[1] "%d Tage"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:328
msgid "Page views"
msgstr "Seitenaufrufe"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:330
msgid "Affiliate link clicks"
msgstr "Klicks auf Partnerlinks"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:343
msgid "Most viewed pages"
msgstr "Meistbesuchte Seiten"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:343
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:347
msgid "Page"
msgstr "Seite"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:344
msgid "Where visitors come from"
msgstr "Woher die Besucher kommen"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:344
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Website"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:345
msgid "Countries"
msgstr "Länder"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:345
msgid "Country"
msgstr "Land"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:346
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Geräte"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:346
msgid "Device"
msgstr "Gerät"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:347
msgid "Affiliate link clicks by page"
msgstr "Klicks auf Partnerlinks je Seite"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:348
msgid "Affiliate link clicks by target"
msgstr "Klicks auf Partnerlinks je Ziel"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:348
msgid "Target"
msgstr "Ziel"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:351
msgid "Visitors are counted per day. Someone who comes on two days counts twice in the total. Countries are estimated from the time zone and language of the browser, not from the address."
msgstr "Besucher werden je Tag gezählt. Wer an zwei Tagen kommt, zählt in der Summe zweimal. Länder werden aus Zeitzone und Sprache des Browsers geschätzt, nicht aus der Adresse."

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:369
msgid "Direct or unknown"
msgstr "Direkt oder unbekannt"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:387
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:388
msgid "Page views per day"
msgstr "Seitenaufrufe je Tag"

#. translators: 1: date, 2: page views, 3: visitors, 4: affiliate link clicks
#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:394
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s: %2$s page views, %3$s visitors, %4$s affiliate link clicks"
msgstr "%1$s: %2$s Seitenaufrufe, %3$s Besucher, %4$s Klicks auf Partnerlinks"

#: includes/class-oneab-stats-admin.php:401
msgid "at most per day"
msgstr "höchstens je Tag"
